    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a420a8de29766da9ff3da5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 拿好板凳 听嘉宾托老师说说他跟滑雪的渊源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 双板转单板竟然是年纪大了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 单板的技术类型分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> SI妹的滑雪路程中托老师功不可没</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1421">23:41</a> 小斤入坑单板，托老师也是影响深远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> 菜鸡在冰箱高级道的快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 新手到底去哪里滑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a> 建议滑雪搭配健身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 滑雪尽头是双板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a> 护具怎么选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> 其他装备的投入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3812">63:32</a> 六院骨科去过了吗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/ll_nfdiFTlwWTZTGhcX9wrGLbqsG.m4a" length="65264271" type="audio/mp4"/>
