  <item>
    <title>S4E17-生活体验|人在囧途之静冈篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692bebff0d5237d4de28cf9f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692bebff0d5237d4de28cf9f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Nov 2025 07:19:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 为啥选择了静冈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 穷鬼选择了坑爹的东航</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> 去日本那么多次 第一次入境翻车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a> SI妹感同身受了斤姐的晕机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 明明台风过了 还是开启了大冒险的按钮 1个小时的路程变成了6个小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 大晚上的太离谱了：关东煮last order＋堂吉诃德竟然不是24小时+看到了兔女郎和醉汉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> &nbsp;“静冈大山酒店”还不错，但没有一个酒店能比得上佐贺的性价比（欢迎回听S3E14-16）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 即使错过了富士山 还是被三保松原的海和天吸引住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> Dream Plaza的离谱事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> 超市工作人员竟然不让SI妹买酒？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 在Cenova的《花束般的恋爱》同款牛排 排队三小时也是不值得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> SI妹超感恩同伴的照顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a> 硬着头皮在静冈晨练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 离谱贯穿全程，直到回上海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2983">49:43</a> 一些零散贴士</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FluyGHuNOeZmftmwPTQAW1yoV_AL.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/lks89R_aLmRJ8ZjskOmCbrrrdZCH.m4a" length="100941295" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
