    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 帝都不欢迎穷鬼P人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 帝都的交通让小吃一斤大吃一惊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 薅了接送机的羊毛，但机票亏了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 酒店测评：秋果S1918庭院式+秋果东直门环球影城店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 餐厅测评：南门涮肉、京悦轩、外婆家、环球内平先生面馆、东来顺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> 帝都会惩罚不做攻略的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2986">49:46</a> 环球有不一样的“烟火”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4098">68:18</a> 本周开心时刻：宜家购物；Coaching考试通过啦！</span></p>]]></description>
