  <item>
    <title>S4E13-生活体验|珠海长隆飞船乐园+海洋王国攻略！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b2d0fc97178f08ee68ef63</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b2d0fc97178f08ee68ef63</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Aug 2025 10:25:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 飞船乐园提前入园很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 打卡攻略和集卡的魔力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">06:59</a> 虎鲸表演很常规，但工作人员非常会整花活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 美人鱼表演挺不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 看光影秀竟然是为了恢复体力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 百慕大历险记和潜艇寻宝值得冲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 三楼其他低幼项目：海洋单轨车、章鱼海盗船、分级别跳楼机、旋转木马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 二楼：碰碰车、卡丁车、探险AR游戏、淘气堡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 搞积分全靠擅长项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 一楼各类主题场馆和室外投喂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> 海洋王国我们又来了：海底互动船非常有意思；冰川过山车和激流勇进结合体心之向往</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a> 王嘉尔推荐的餐厅打卡，“飞走”到底是什么？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 潮汕火锅，性价比极高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a> 答疑时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a> 本周开心时刻：一周录了三期节目</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/lhB5JneOPWXLrGSQgrE64TtJPUUL.m4a" length="80311003" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S4E12-生活体验|珠海长隆亲子游初体验！（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6887718a8e06fe8de71e5c21</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6887718a8e06fe8de71e5c21</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 上海机场贵宾厅贴士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 航班被取消但斤姐硬要回来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 上海虹桥机场超快打车贴士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 珠海情侣路亚朵和华美达怎么选</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> 顺德菜：粤禧顺，非招牌菜不要点，不要问我为什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 三块钱修鞋是什么体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 对早茶大家都有自己的想法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 长隆入住重要提醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 儿童推车租赁性价比的天花板</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2488">41:28</a> 娃子不受控攻略等于零</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a> 酒店羊毛没薅成功，飞行棋集了好几套</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3111">51:51</a> 长隆秀很值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 如何购买和选择酒店＋乐园套餐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3531">58:51</a> 推荐在房间看烟花</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">61:10</a> 本周开心时刻：话剧千与千寻；第一顿小龙虾</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/livauxFXSUTaOmgQ6M2OAgpr8efC.m4a" length="122672515" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S4E11-生活体验|大理游学初体验之终于学了！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686c6a0593fd2d72b8099745</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686c6a0593fd2d72b8099745</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 00:46:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去大理前非常期待，希望通过课程能唤醒沉睡的身体感知。每天嘻嘻哈哈的上课，但身体在悄然发生变化，僵硬的颈椎变得灵活、难受的感冒被治愈、封闭的感官被激活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也就呆了一周，回到城市后，钢筋水泥的压迫感竟让人无所适从。大理的美，在于它的天然纯粹，灵性自在，无拘无束。那里的阳光、空气和山水，都让人自然而然地放松、舒展。等下一个契机再见大理！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> 魔镜卡时刻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsm9NzAcGlYDPLRDgy82F8JFpqUs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 大理课程的总体感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 早课-曾子家学大学修身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> 舞蹈课-社会大剧院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 学喝茶-申时茶，三焦茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">47:06</a> 大理的美妙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 本周开心时刻：幸运抢到上影节票；全新的垂类播客上线啦，欢迎订阅收听！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuqxPEm5nX0B6Z_BXpj8QKl9tY7e.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj89P_xaWfh6eCGv675mevqLM_I3.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/lrIOyx-pxPCw1Zh22JCJIbzgn1vE.m4a" length="103978814" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S4E10-生活体验|大理游玩之吃喝+体验篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6858083f4abe6e29cb6978b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6858083f4abe6e29cb6978b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Jun 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期为大家大众点评大理吃喝，同时还有我们参与的一些游玩体验~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> 魔镜卡时刻：勇敢、幸运、不知者无畏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5wltNa72Xh0o8h5HORHIza9ERw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 喜洲翰林餐厅（民国百年老宅）建筑很有特色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 乳条和酒很搭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 朴石Simple Stone：菜品很棒 (茶包：拍拍农场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> 跳房子咖啡店：可以看到古城全景，有露台，景色非常好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 为了子弟薯片去逛了小卖铺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> 大理九月：民谣夜一般，据说每天会有不同曲风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 亚细亚：jam night绝！斤姐很欣赏小号哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 接触即兴工作坊：初体验冲击很大</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/lvILuPk9mpontKb9frMJPp54js-t.m4a" length="96407142" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S4E9-生活体验|大理游学初体验之游玩攻略篇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683b08af31215eb506b10611</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683b08af31215eb506b10611</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 May 2025 13:50:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> 魔镜卡时刻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvsqae_O5kAiWbAQJEXmxfLxHfI4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 浦东机场的面可以吃两碗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 大理果然是个有风的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 民宿测评：了凡小院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 木头火塘·本地特色火塘烧烤：烤鸡脚极其惊艳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 不仅完美错过日出，早餐店都没开，斤姐的胃口从路边餐车开始翻倍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 大理人的chill感无处不在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 苍山敞篷缆车绝对不能错过</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm__HuD0p2fEWz5G2bkup8BBCqg1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">32:56</a> 中和寺的狗子也必须rua（不急很乖），斋饭必须恰（第一次吃稀豆粉），观景平台必须上（人少景美）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FleHMQWVd6yEdhJhAAt8z4z4iLtJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a>民宿测评：花缦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> S湾生态廊桥：电动车载人初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 廊桥：拍照秩序井然</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBe2csDqvjqS4DRooXmbcz8aitp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> 喜洲古镇：喜洲粑粑麻麻的，普洱青梅酒可以尝试，烤肉烤菌子店很会营销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3543">59:03</a> 本周开心时刻：门后不是镜子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/lkCkAHfNyfXnsO8RgzF-fMnMT_PM.m4a" length="116869663" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S4E8-尴尬系列|尴尬:成长的必经之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680f94b67a449ae8583e4970</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680f94b67a449ae8583e4970</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> 魔镜卡时刻：我们还是宝子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvgm7rITZg3F6q3ZqoIbhsAfmy7v.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（评论区告诉我们，你们看到了什么哦）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 手还是很滑，真的很好奇Teams和飞书有撤回功能吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 除了手滑，脑子也滑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> 他是大卫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 我是波哥</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 当着本人的面聊本人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> 超明显摸鱼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a> 头撞树撞玻璃撞路灯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 吸面现场空气突然安静</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 袜子破了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 耳朵听不见</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 祝大家新年快乐，谢谢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a> 为老板开门又失败了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 冰糖葫芦饮品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1914">31:54</a> 超不friend行为</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> 鞋跟连掉三次</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 衣服穿反简直人之常情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 耳机事故</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 油腻谐音梗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2963">49:23</a> 本周开心时刻：享受春天</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62c804ee60b7e10199481a6a/lsmqB95ohG6EP4Y9XTLoXt0a_fb2.m4a" length="101707725" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo0szO__CDXBe-AauRu3kCBrfs8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
